"would_change_if\":\"The repo already declares click/typer, or the tool is planned to exceed three simple subcommands.\"}\nEOF\npython3 - <<'EOF'\np='goal.md'\ns=open(p).read()\ns=s.replace(\"deep-thinker (opus) and devils-advocate (opus) were dispatched but had not replied after two tally attempts, so they counted as missing; 3 valid replies, all A. Panel degraded (2 of 5 roles missing), not a unanimous five-role result.\",\"deep-thinker (opus) and devils-advocate (opus) had not replied after two tally attempts, so the decision was taken on 3 valid replies, all A (panel degraded, 2 of 5 roles missing). devils-advocate replied afterwards (saved as round1/devils-advocate.json): its strongest attack on A (hand-written dispatch, required=True pitfall, SystemExit in tests) is one-time boilerplate, and it still picked A. deep-thinker never replied.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -c \"devils-advocate replied afterwards\" goal.md"}}}
